      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1754800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "100M users \u00d7 10 uploads/day = 1B uploads/day\n  \u2192 ~12K writes/sec avg, ~60K peak (5\u00d7)\n  \u2192 1 PB/day ingest \u21d2 dedup is survival, not polish\nreads \u2248 10\u00d7 writes \u2248 120K reads/sec\n  \u2192 almost all must terminate at the CDN\n\nceiling is the METADATA DB, not storage \u2014\nthe object store scales itself.",
      "originalText": "100M users \u00d7 10 uploads/day = 1B uploads/day\n  \u2192 ~12K writes/sec avg, ~60K peak (5\u00d7)\n  \u2192 1 PB/day ingest \u21d2 dedup is survival, not polish\nreads \u2248 10\u00d7 writes \u2248 120K reads/sec\n  \u2192 almost all must terminate at the CDN\n\nceiling is the METADATA DB, not storage \u2014\nthe object store scales itself.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false
