      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "bytes at a blobKey never change \u21d2 If-Range can\nNEVER mismatch \u21d2 the 200-full-body path never fires\n\u21d2 resume always succeeds, however long you were offline.\n\nSame decision already removed object-store overwrite\nconsistency from the picture (\u00a76).\n\nParallel segmented download: 4 concurrent ranges\npwrite() into a preallocated sparse file \u2014 beats one\nwindow/RTT-limited TCP stream; each segment resumes\nindependently. Cost: 4\u00d7 conns, more CDN pressure.",
      "originalText": "bytes at a blobKey never change \u21d2 If-Range can\nNEVER mismatch \u21d2 the 200-full-body path never fires\n\u21d2 resume always succeeds, however long you were offline.\n\nSame decision already removed object-store overwrite\nconsistency from the picture (\u00a76).\n\nParallel segmented download: 4 concurrent ranges\npwrite() into a preallocated sparse file \u2014 beats one\nwindow/RTT-limited TCP stream; each segment resumes\nindependently. Cost: 4\u00d7 conns, more CDN pressure.",
