      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1754800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE ASYMMETRY \u2014  upload resume is STATEFUL: the server holds durable partial state (uploadId + landed parts) and the client asks \"what did you get?\"\n                 download resume is STATELESS: the client holds the partial state and tells the server \"start from here\", with If-Range guarding correctness.",
      "originalText": "THE ASYMMETRY \u2014  upload resume is STATEFUL: the server holds durable partial state (uploadId + landed parts) and the client asks \"what did you get?\"\n                 download resume is STATELESS: the client holds the partial state and tells the server \"start from here\", with If-Range guarding correctness.",
